  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4324</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5101</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Beryl&gt;。
『ノーテン菌』とはなんだ？
自分のデータベースには記録がない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Beryl&gt;. What is this “dumbug”
disease you speak of? There are
no such records in my database.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4544</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5102</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ボクが発見した
人間に寄生する恐ろしい菌だよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's this terrifying virus I discovered that
grows on certain people like a parasite.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4928</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5103</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>感染した人間は
ノリと勢いだけで、人生を
ユカイに生きようとするんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>When a person gets infected,
they just obliviously bumble through
life without a thought in their head.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5348</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5104</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>了解。記録した。
……&lt;Shing&gt;の感染確率は
３００％以上だな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Understood. Definition recorded.
The chance of &lt;Shing&gt; being infected
with said virus is over 300%.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5664</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C5105</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>感染してるどころか
ノーテン菌の発生源っ！
ノーテン菌のお母さんだよっ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's no “chance” about it!
HE started it, HE'S the freakin' source!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
